    <abstract id="aspace_a4ac830010796a1b57d6f9b89859c4fc">The Julie Ault Papers on Artists Call (1978-2007) is a collection of materials related to Artists Call Against U.S. Intervention in Central America, a mobilization of artists and other activists to raise awareness of and protest against United States military intervention in squashing left-wing governments in Central America. The collection contains exhibition materials, correspondence, fliers, posters, other promotional materials, and clippings.</abstract>
    <langmaterial id="aspace_bb286665dc5e994801f517c33294a6f3">Collection is in English and Spanish.</langmaterial>
  </did>
